OL,3,AUS Supreme Court denies Christa Pike's
OL,4,Alast-ditch bid to halt execution
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US Supreme Court has declined to
OL,7,Fstop the execution of Tennessee inmate
OL,8,FChrista Pike on the eve of the date
OL,9,Fappointed for her death by lethal
OL,10,Finjection.
OL,12,FPike, 50, has been awaiting execution
OL,13,Fsince she was convicted and sentenced
OL,14,Fto death in 1996 for the murder of a
OL,15,Fteenage classmate.
OL,17,FHoping for a last-minute reprieve, her
OL,18,Fattorneys filed a petition with the
OL,19,Fhigh court ahead of her scheduled
OL,20,Fexecution on Wednesday morning.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
