OL,3,AUS Supreme Court denies Christa Pike's
OL,4,Alast-ditch bid to halt execution
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut after the high court's decision to
OL,7,Fdeny that request, Pike will be the
OL,8,Ffirst woman to be executed in Tennessee
OL,9,Fin more than 200 years. Only 18 women
OL,10,Fhave been executed in the US since the
OL,11,F1970s, compared to 1,663 men.
